{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_198b9a40b18c3500cb4fc900d0af22c77ad2701cca1e757db87c1059f458473d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"qaml-ai/camelai@5f3c295d66fd snapshot ceee23502cd9df82","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_98e71ed076c8551c9a8ceb6e7663d80f70511de303a926e97ddeed8c2d74d711","slc_d1c7b1c5c431b2507865fe86f178d3d2945f7b6bc4f68bbb88fe8835b01cc483"],"source_ids":["src_4c125861811955f6a4df678d2909abe8"],"text":"Self-hosted deployments expose GET /api/selfhost/health as both the readiness endpoint and a versioned machine-readable capability contract; failed runtime checks return HTTP 503 with status fail.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_431e205479994e2aaf4be0fffdc678f8a3e1e9b89bde2cb2418bb0c7942e3f70","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"qaml-ai/camelai@5f3c295d66fd snapshot ceee23502cd9df82","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b7f0e2a2ecaca6bf52d9b0b0e21e56b3d3b100cecdf105f492ffec2a4878e343"],"source_ids":["src_0aac67beaf5555fc942d07c14432354f"],"text":"The self-hosted target intentionally lacks outbound email, password-email verification, and multi-node failover.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5a5054962e7f62e5f7ffe5dc0c3e47bd4734c919319bd15439e9ca3ec5603742","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"qaml-ai/camelai@5f3c295d66fd snapshot ceee23502cd9df82","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_522173c47bd18bbe1fb9a933bbfef076e2f2837a75206b26d9f1b9b312a1800f","slc_ef0969727cbf62f3175a5725f5415cebf2300f5c0539dc21bb3164e76d0549fe"],"source_ids":["src_0aac67beaf5555fc942d07c14432354f"],"text":"Linux sandbox containers are reserved for short-lived jobs (app builds, notebook analysis, SQL queries); project deploys flow through a build sandbox to Workers for Platforms, and a dispatcher Worker routes requests to published apps.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5e9a0e1144ca8ecfcf0f277d84ab7888b113a30856e9e2e6247ae9c928aaea16","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"qaml-ai/camelai@5f3c295d66fd snapshot ceee23502cd9df82","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_63769513fb0bb2f30607629d9fe86e87998d6f4ede22598253ac0440658e7f62"],"source_ids":["src_4c125861811955f6a4df678d2909abe8"],"text":"In self-host mode the application container has read-write Docker-socket access so workerd can manage sandbox containers; anyone controlling that container should be treated as having root-equivalent VM control.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_601e859402ab1fd65a5e690114d300d8c6279c17f37a57abe6b2a87dcb339ff2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"qaml-ai/camelai@5f3c295d66fd snapshot ceee23502cd9df82","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0f1eab3d6acea6b4968b29358092ea42c8490b3cd1d775964e3aaab451653cb3","slc_5a085c9bdad8bc33b078705fb4329c77b29cbe6759a6a9c94baa0aac8beb67ed","slc_fd68525618ccce8bc204a0384292fc05a0c5c6a8e1d0f1dd647482e32ca233d8"],"source_ids":["src_ee49ca587313509b9a0647c26d9ea7f2"],"text":"Enterprise SSO uses OIDC and is configured per organization at Settings → Organization → Single sign-on, with fields for issuer URL, client ID/secret, token auth method, email claim, allowed domains, and an uninvited-users toggle.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7225ccde0f524d2c7ff44ad39db83e362d44a93fa272cc000388deffca84cc8a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"qaml-ai/camelai@5f3c295d66fd snapshot ceee23502cd9df82","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_56b14557aebf735b730e799c310cd5db4e4a34d96ae55a486415062e5350eaed"],"source_ids":["src_0aac67beaf5555fc942d07c14432354f"],"text":"The agent writes JavaScript instead of bash; Code Mode runs it in fresh V8 isolates with explicit platform and connection methods, and credentials remain outside the execution sandbox.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7e4102305bfd68ca4ccba87b7f58ab2c175d0ac62e2c2adf931f5c033adc1079","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"qaml-ai/camelai@5f3c295d66fd snapshot ceee23502cd9df82","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_407e1ea81e28e191b3e50a06247357ae56fa1cfd417cadd05c28b7218f34a27d","slc_5d1a9560028aafee21f211688cbe11eb4edca74e7689226bdabbef4d2a374a41"],"source_ids":["src_0aac67beaf5555fc942d07c14432354f"],"text":"The repository includes agent evals run via 'bun run test:eval <eval-id>' by manifest ID, requiring Docker and additional credentials.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c8af81d71844b747895c24a61502a0d15d5639e1f6df33dbe9737d2116a1789c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"qaml-ai/camelai@5f3c295d66fd snapshot ceee23502cd9df82","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0063364bad37a796050e1f0077a2d49dfca9ac79da9fdcff395bbb5cdfd2b9d0","slc_56b14557aebf735b730e799c310cd5db4e4a34d96ae55a486415062e5350eaed"],"source_ids":["src_0aac67beaf5555fc942d07c14432354f"],"text":"Each chat thread runs its own coding agent inside a Cloudflare Durable Object (ChatThreadDO), which owns the agent loop and persistent chat state.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e3b6115fae1f540bc58cf051436693dad2f772e12d44f78a15b70ace82991c4e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"qaml-ai/camelai@5f3c295d66fd snapshot ceee23502cd9df82","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0b29593fa81365d32681e231f8bcdc86bc80fa49fc5e296330bbe57dcfdb8810"],"source_ids":["src_0aac67beaf5555fc942d07c14432354f"],"text":"The agent harness is camelAI's own, built from pi's lower-level agent-loop and state-management libraries; Anthropic, OpenAI, OpenRouter, Bedrock, and custom endpoints supply only the model, not the harness.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_46e206ed22a34ea0b82aa0f48b7fcc89"}
